    "\n",
    "# Part A. Exact 3D Gaussian--OT diagnostic\n",
    "\n",
    "This section computes \\(\\mathfrak G(\\mathscr Q,U,\\mathcal O)\\) exactly. Let \\(Y\\) stack all Gaussian variables, and suppose\n",
    "\\[\n",
    "U_t=A_tY,\\qquad S_t=B_tY.\n",
    "\\]\n",
    "Then\n",
    "\\[\n",
    "g(t)=\\operatorname{Tr}\\left[A_t\\Sigma_Y A_t^\\top - A_t\\Sigma_Y B_t^\\top(B_t\\Sigma_Y B_t^\\top)^{-1}B_t\\Sigma_Y A_t^\\top\\right].\n",
    "\\]\n",
    "No kNN, no PCA, and no neural training are used.\n"
   ]
